      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785316138351,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Generate Short URL using either below\n1. using long url prefix\n2. using number random generator like UUID\n3. hash the URL\n    md5(long URL) -> hash -> base64(hash)[:6]\n4. use the Counter, every time will keep counter\nuse squids.ord(one -> one mapping).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Generate Short URL using either below\n1. using long url prefix\n2. using number random generator like UUID\n3. hash the URL\n    md5(long URL) -> hash -> base64(hash)[:6]\n4. use the Counter, every time will keep counter\nuse squids.ord(one -> one mapping).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
